{"ref":"BDB, עֵ֫זֶר²","hw":"עֵ֫זֶר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵ֫זֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>Ph. and OHeb. <span dir=\"rtl\">עזר</span> Lzb<sup>338</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a wall-builder <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">Ne 3:19</a>, Αζουρ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  name in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.4\">1 Ch 4:4</a>, Αζηρ, Εζερ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  hero of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.10\">1 Ch 12:10</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.9\">9</a>), Αζερ, etc.","next":"BDB, עֶ֫זֶר","prev":"BDB, עֵ֫זֶר"}